{"title": "未知", "index": 36, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre2\">\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00023.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withmanycharactors\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">叔本华（1788～1860），德国哲学家，首倡唯意志论</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00078.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withmanycharactors\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">叔本华与他的对手黑格尔（1770～1831）</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00074.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withmanycharactors\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">完成《作为意志和表象的世界》第一部时的叔本华（三十岁）</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00007.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">沉思中的叔本华</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00069.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withmanycharactors\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">叔本华的偶像伊曼努尔·康德（1724～1804）</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00072.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">《叔本华著作全集》德文版的扉页</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00096.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withmanycharactors\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">叔本华安眠之地：法兰克福北郊的中央公墓</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00037.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">德国悲观主义哲学家叔本华</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00060.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">德国唯意志论代表人物叔本华</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00064.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">叔本华藏书票</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00036.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withmanycharactors\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">叔本华的母亲约翰娜·叔本华（左）和他的妹妹（右）</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00024.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">法兰克福的叔本华故居</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00084.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">叔本华纪念室一角</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00048.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">《作为意志和表象的世界》原稿之一</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00092.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">叔本华胸像</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00077.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">叔本华自画像</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00033.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">法兰克福的叔本华纪念碑</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00004.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withmanycharactors\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">叔本华纪念碑台座的狮身人面像斯芬克司</span></p>\n</div>\n</body>"}]}